# Copy to .env.local for `vercel dev`, or set in the Vercel dashboard
# (Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables) for Production/Preview.
# Never commit the real key.

# Required for AI sound generation (api/generate-sound.js).
# Get one at https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys — music generation
# requires a paid ElevenLabs plan. Without this set, Inktone falls back to
# its local Web Audio synth automatically.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
